            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/DJI_0760_%28_Ahsan_Manzil%29.jpg/1280px-DJI_0760_%28_Ahsan_Manzil%29.jpg",
            "file": "DJI 0760 ( Ahsan Manzil).jpg",
