            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/BRUNEI_NATIONAL_MUSEUM%2C_BRUNEI.jpg/1280px-BRUNEI_NATIONAL_MUSEUM%2C_BRUNEI.jpg",
