            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/BN-bsb-jame-asr-hassanil-m-2.jpg/1280px-BN-bsb-jame-asr-hassanil-m-2.jpg",
            "file": "BN-bsb-jame-asr-hassanil-m-2.jpg",
            "author": "Balou46",
