            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Aerial_Foz_de_Igua%C3%A7u_26_Nov_2005.jpg/1280px-Aerial_Foz_de_Igua%C3%A7u_26_Nov_2005.jpg",
            "file": "Aerial Foz de Iguaçu 26 Nov 2005.jpg",
            "author": "Mariordo",
