                "fr": "La caye Caulker, en anglais Caulker Caye, en espagnol Cayo Caulker, est une petite île corallienne située près des côtes du Belize dans les Caraïbes.",
                "en": "Caye Caulker is a small limestone coral island off the coast of Belize in the Caribbean Sea measuring about 5 miles by less than 1 mile. The town on the island is known by the name Caye Caulker Village. The population of Caye Caulker is approximately 4,000 people. Caye Caulker is located approximately 20 miles north-northeast of Belize City, and is accessible by high-speed water taxi or small plane via Caye Caulker Airport."
