            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Sunrise_near_Mossaka_%28Congo%29.JPG/1280px-Sunrise_near_Mossaka_%28Congo%29.JPG",
            "file": "Sunrise near Mossaka (Congo).JPG",
            "author": "Bsm15",
