            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/.00_2522_Schloss_Sanssouci_in_Potsdam.jpg/1280px-.00_2522_Schloss_Sanssouci_in_Potsdam.jpg",
