            "description": {
                "fr": "Ingapirca est un complexe archéologique situé dans la province de Cañar, en Équateur.",
                "en": "Ingapirca is a town in Cañar Province, Ecuador, and the name of the older Inca ruins and archeological site nearby. These are the largest known Inca ruins in Ecuador. The most significant building is the Temple of the Sun, an elliptically shaped building constructed around a large rock."
            }
