                "en": "Pärnu Beach is a beach of Pärnu Bay, administratively in Pärnu, Estonia. In a sunny summer day, tens of thousand sunbathers and swimmers visit the beach. The beach area includes swings, surfing equipment rental and a mini golf area. A number of hotels are located by the beach, such as Pärnu Rannahotell, Pärnu Mud Baths and Tervise Paradiis. The beach promenade was renovated in 2021."
