            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Luxor%2C_Egypt%2C_Karnak.jpg/1280px-Luxor%2C_Egypt%2C_Karnak.jpg",
            "file": "Luxor, Egypt, Karnak.jpg",
