                "en": "The Guggenheim Museum Bilbao is a museum of modern and contemporary art in Bilbao, Biscay, Spain. In 2008, the museum revealed that it was looking into building a 5,000 m2 expansion in the Urdaibai estuary, a UNESCO biosphere reserve located east of Bilbao. By 2022, the Biscay government presented plans to put €40 million toward the expansion."
