                "fr": "Semuc Champey est une aire protégée dans le département d'Alta Verapaz au Guatemala près de la ville maya de Lanquín.",
                "en": "Semuc Champey is a natural enclave in the department of Alta Verapaz, Guatemala, it consists of a natural 300-metre karst landbridge formed by travertine limestone deposits, beneath which the main flow of the Cahabón River plunges into a subterranean cave system via a natural sinkhole."
