            "fame": 14,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Le mont Lamlam est une montagne de Guam, le point culminant du territoire. Elle se situe à une altitude de 406 mètres près d'Agat.",
                "en": "Mount Lamlam is a peak on the United States island of Guam. It is located near the village of Agat, in the south-west of the island. Rising to 406 meters above sea level, the distance from the peak to the bottom of the nearby Mariana Trench is said to be the greatest change in elevation on Earth over such a short distance."
            }
