            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Citadelle_Laferri%C3%A8re_Aerial_View.jpg/1280px-Citadelle_Laferri%C3%A8re_Aerial_View.jpg",
            "file": "Citadelle Laferrière Aerial View.jpg",
            "author": "Gibran Torres",
