            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Liechtenstein_asv2022-10_img22_Vaduz_Schloss.jpg/1280px-Liechtenstein_asv2022-10_img22_Vaduz_Schloss.jpg",
