            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Palais_royal_Rova_Manjakamiadana_2.jpg/1280px-Palais_royal_Rova_Manjakamiadana_2.jpg",
            "file": "Palais royal Rova Manjakamiadana 2.jpg",
