            "fame": 21,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Likiep, anciennement Comte Hayden au moment de sa découverte par les Européens, est un atoll des îles Marshall. Mentionné le 5 novembre 1817 par le navigateur Otto von Kotzebue, commandant du vaisseau Rurik, lors de l'expédition Romanzoff de 1815 à 1818 à la recherche d'une route par les mers du nord.",
                "en": "Likiep Atoll is a coral atoll of 65 islands in the Pacific Ocean, and forms a legislative district of the Ratak Chain of the Marshall Islands. The first recorded sighting by Europeans was by the Spanish expedition of Ruy López de Villalobos in January 1543. On 5 January 1565, its sighting was again recorded by the patache San Lucas, commanded by Alonso de Arellano, part of the Spanish expedition of Miguel López de Legazpi, which had by then separated from Legazpi's fleet."
            }
