            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Old_Bagan%2C_Myanmar%2C_Bagan_plains_at_sunset.jpg/1280px-Old_Bagan%2C_Myanmar%2C_Bagan_plains_at_sunset.jpg",
            "file": "Old Bagan, Myanmar, Bagan plains at sunset.jpg",
