            "fame": 13,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Cape Maclear ou Chembe est une ville du Malawi, située dans la région du Sud. Elle est au sud du lac Malawi.",
                "en": "Cape Maclear or Chembe is a town in the Mangochi District of Malawi's Southern Region. The town, on the Nankumba Peninsula, is on the southern shore of Lake Malawi and is the busiest resort on Lake Malawi. Cape Maclear is close to the islands of Domwe, Thumbwe and Mumbo Island on Lake Malawi, and is in Lake Malawi National Park."
            }
