            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Kinabalu_Sabah_Borneo_Kampong_Kundasang_2.jpg/1280px-Kinabalu_Sabah_Borneo_Kampong_Kundasang_2.jpg",
