            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Toma_a%C3%A9rea_del_Fuerte_San_Lorenzo.jpg/1280px-Toma_a%C3%A9rea_del_Fuerte_San_Lorenzo.jpg",
            "file": "Toma aérea del Fuerte San Lorenzo.jpg",
            "author": "Garcia.dennis",
