            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Machu_Picchu%2C_2023_%28012%29.jpg/1280px-Machu_Picchu%2C_2023_%28012%29.jpg",
            "file": "Machu Picchu, 2023 (012).jpg",
