            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Badshahi_Mosque_July_1_2005_pic32_by_Ali_Imran_%281%29.jpg/1280px-Badshahi_Mosque_July_1_2005_pic32_by_Ali_Imran_%281%29.jpg",
