            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Castelo_dos_Mouros._Sintra%2C_Portugal.jpg/1280px-Castelo_dos_Mouros._Sintra%2C_Portugal.jpg",
