                "en": "Lusail Stadium is a football stadium in Lusail, Qatar. The Procurement process for the stadium conversion began in 2014. The stadium was built as a joint venture by HBK Contracting and the China Railway Construction Corporation. Like the other stadiums that planned the 2022 World Cup, the Lusail Stadium is cooled using solar power and is claimed to have zero carbon footprint."
