            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/ROM_C%C3%A2r%C8%9Bi%C8%99oara_Transf%C4%83g%C4%83r%C4%83%C8%99an_42.jpg/1280px-ROM_C%C3%A2r%C8%9Bi%C8%99oara_Transf%C4%83g%C4%83r%C4%83%C8%99an_42.jpg",
