            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Studenica_monastery_%28Manastir_Studenica%29_-_by_Pudelek.jpg/1280px-Studenica_monastery_%28Manastir_Studenica%29_-_by_Pudelek.jpg",
