                "en": "The Singapore Botanic Gardens is a tropical garden located at the fringe of the Orchard Road shopping district in Singapore. The first \"Botanical and Experimental Garden\" in Singapore was established in 1822 on Government Hill by Sir Stamford Raffles, the founder of modern Singapore and a keen naturalist."
