            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/San_Salvador_-_El_Salvador_%2850899440617%29.jpg/1280px-San_Salvador_-_El_Salvador_%2850899440617%29.jpg",
            "file": "San Salvador - El Salvador (50899440617).jpg",
            "author": "Rômulo Gama Ferreira",
