            "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/View_to_Mt_Tatamailau%2C_Ainaro_on_a_clear_day.jpg",
            "file": "View to Mt Tatamailau, Ainaro on a clear day.jpg",
