            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Rustam_Minnikhanov%27s_trip_to_Turkmenistan_2008_11.jpg/1280px-Rustam_Minnikhanov%27s_trip_to_Turkmenistan_2008_11.jpg",
