            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Chr%C3%A1m_svat%C3%A9ho_Michala.jpg/1280px-Chr%C3%A1m_svat%C3%A9ho_Michala.jpg",
