                "fr": "La vieille ville de Hội An est un site patrimonial et un ancien comptoir commercial situé à Hội An, qui a servi de comptoir important pour les commerçants étrangers au Vietnam du XVe au XIXe siècle, statut que la ville plus récente maintient encore en partie aujourd’hui. Ce territoire faisait initialement partie de la culture de Sa Huỳnh, puis a été revendiqué par le royaume du Champā à partir du début du IIe siècle.",
                "en": "Hoi An Ancient Town is a heritage site and ancient trading post located in Hoi An, which served as an important trading post for foreign traders to Vietnam from the 15th until the 19th century, the status of which is still partly maintained by the newer city today. This patch of land was initially part of the Sa Huỳnh culture, and eventually was claimed by the Kingdom of Champa from the beginning of the 2nd century."
