            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Robben_Island_-_Cape_Town%2C_South_Africa_%283883849594%29.jpg/1280px-Robben_Island_-_Cape_Town%2C_South_Africa_%283883849594%29.jpg",
            "file": "Robben Island - Cape Town, South Africa (3883849594).jpg",
