            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Ariane_5ECA_on_its_launch_platform_on_its_way_to_lauch_pad_ELA-3.jpg/1280px-Ariane_5ECA_on_its_launch_platform_on_its_way_to_lauch_pad_ELA-3.jpg",
            "file": "Ariane 5ECA on its launch platform on its way to lauch pad ELA-3.jpg",
