                "en": "Saint-François is a town and commune in the French overseas department of Guadeloupe, located in the southeast point of the main island of Grande-Terre. Settlements include Chassaing, and Dubedou. There are four public preschools and eight public primary schools. The Collège Alexandre Macal is a public junior high school."
