            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Mount_Everest_as_seen_from_Drukair2_PLW_edit.jpg/1280px-Mount_Everest_as_seen_from_Drukair2_PLW_edit.jpg",
